1. Pet Adoption App
○ Design classes for Pet, Dog, Cat, and Bird. Use inheritance and constructors
to initialize them.

Start

class Pet 
Attribute Name
constructor Pet(Name)
name = Name


class Dog extends Pet
Attribute Name
constructor Dog(Name)
name = name
method to PrintName
Print "Name"


class Cat extends Pet
Attribute Name
constructor Cat(Name)
name = name
method to PrintName
Print "Name"


class Bird extends Pet
Attribute Name
constructor Bird(Name)
name = name
method to PrintName
Print "Name"
End

